<view class="container atlas">
  <view class="eyebrow">QUE LENS · 雀镜</view>
  <view class="hero-title">从家乡，开一桌。</view>
  <view class="muted">找熟悉的玩法，读懂每一手好牌。</view>
  <view class="location-panel">
    <view class="location-title">跟着位置，找到本地玩法</view>
    <view class="muted">仅在点击授权后读取一次位置，不保存、不上传。</view>
    <button class="primary" bindtap="locate" loading="{{locating}}" disabled="{{locating}}">{{locating ? '正在寻找附近玩法' : '定位到当地玩法'}}</button>
    <view wx:if="{{locationMessage}}" class="location-message" role="status">{{locationMessage}}</view>
  </view>
  <view class="section-heading">热门麻将 <text class="section-small">三种风味，随你选择</text></view>
  <view class="card-grid">
  <button wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="id" class="region-card {{item.tone}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="openRegion" disabled="{{locating}}" aria-label="{{item.name}}">
    <image class="region-art" src="/assets/regions/{{item.art}}.svg" mode="aspectFit" />
    <view class="card-copy"><view class="card-tag">{{item.tag}}</view><view class="card-name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="card-caption">{{item.caption}}</view><view class="card-link">探索玩法　↗</view></view>
  </button>
  </view>
  <view class="footer-note">各地规则陆续收录 · 成都牌型检查已开放</view>
  <button class="text-button" bindtap="about">使用说明与隐私</button>
</view>